Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.43,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:52.42,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:57.74,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.20,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You should go sleep for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.60,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:09.52,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I wouldn't be able to wake up if I took a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:14.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go out and breathe in some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:16.50,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.02,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:19.05,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody should take a break, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:26.14,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Call me on my cellphone if there's anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:32.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The deadline for the script is tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:33.46,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:05.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:10.68,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:17.00,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{Orig:}{It's like ice; it's set too cold.}Your hands are so cold. We've got the A/C set too high.{Rewrote whole line-AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:22.97,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Men's sweat will dirty the scripts if the air-conditioner is turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:26.11,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{ORIGINAL:I heard stress can also cause your hands and legs to be cold.}{I heard stress can cause poor circulation in your extremities.}{TLC}I heard that stress can cool you down, as well.{TLCed}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.16,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:41.42,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That new job you mentioned you wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:47.54,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's worth sacrificing the quality of our work just to pick up another job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:53.94,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, your mind and body are not that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.66,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, we're doing fine right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to work so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.57,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.40,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:05.82,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,My popularity is surging right now, but we can't be too sure about next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:10.28,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There are lots of new artists out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:16.96,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,We may be left behind if we're not careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, you're too pessimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.72,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't healthy for your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:26.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there's ink on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:32.43,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:35.64,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a girl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:42.02,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a girl! I'm a manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:46.99,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:53.29,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for disturbing all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:56.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Man, it's so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:06:00.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel like going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:11.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I just called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:14.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, it's too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:17.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do you feel cooler like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:18.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:23.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's prepare the lunch box.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:24.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:40.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come over and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's summer vacation has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:50.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We make our lunch boxes together in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:52.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,After that, Rin goes to the student childcare centre. {Note: gakudou hoikujou 学童保育所 = childcare of school students mainly, either after school hours or during vacation when there's no school}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:58.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's visit Grandpa's grave this Saturday. {hakamairi 墓参り = Grave visit}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's going to be the Bon Festival soon. {Obon お盆 = Bon Festival http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Obon}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:00.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just in time for you{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:02.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:04.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? You don't want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:08.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The Bellflowers haven't bloomed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:13.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it'll take a while more for it to bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:16.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's buy from the florist this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then we'll wait for ours to bloom before we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:28.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, Grandpa will surely be happy if you bring along the Bellflower that you planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right? Right? Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:36.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But Grandpa is most happy when you visit his grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:56.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I probably wouldn't have been so thoughtful of Grandpa if Rin wasn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:08:00.61,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan~! Rin-chan~!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:02.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:06.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll want to do it all over again, now that you moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:07.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, why is your hair so fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:13.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno.{slang, a little kid would say this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:27.11,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:29.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! We're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:34.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing, that imp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:37.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how many days more to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... about 10 more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.46,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.49,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The skin of a cicada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:50.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:55.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is somewhat nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:59.35,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There are still many in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:02.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What! It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop shaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.98,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,We're running late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.94,0:09:11.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! {\alpha&FFFFFF}Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:20.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here lots of times.{a little kid would say "lots of" and not "many"}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:22.31,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,With Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:23.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:27.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see, Grandma has already passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:31.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, it's {\i1}my{\i0} grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:36.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My mom is Grandpa and Grandma's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:39.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm the child of my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:42.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so Aunty is Grandpa's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:48.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But... I'll be sisters with Aunty if that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(550,0)}I was too careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I never intended for the conversation to go in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:55.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:58.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!　
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The tomb is wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:15.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That flower vase...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san also had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She didn't even come for the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! I'll be back very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:36.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.43,0:10:38.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:43.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pull out the weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:10.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, she actually came with a guy to visit the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:22.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:34.78,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.55,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Why were you hiding in a place like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:39.01,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I even thought you were someone dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:43.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to visit the grave, only that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:46.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I should at least let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:50.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is also here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In front of Grandpa's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:59.00,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Erm... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:06.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Erm... I really care for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:08.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Frankly speaking, I don't really feel anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your personal reasons are also none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As long as Rin doesn't want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:16.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't intend to let the two of you meet from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.55,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I know that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:24.05,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What do you specifically want to say after chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:29.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm asking if you want to at least take a peek at Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:35.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We'll tidy up the grave later, and leave after lighting the joss sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:38.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's still a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is still waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:48.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:51.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be doing what I'm supposed to do.{without "there" sounds much more powerful}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:06.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... I'm sorry... for making you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:20.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... I had something to do....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:23.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:26.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you wait for long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:30.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:41.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:42.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:44.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Place it over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:45.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:58.69,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She's no longer a baby now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:03.47,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Blood ties are so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.47,0:14:04.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:06.11,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:09.07,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,From behind... {It's actually "back figure/shape/appearance", please change appropriately. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:12.58,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,960)}She's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:15.70,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1500)}That sense of distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.91,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,0)}It's exactly the same as Souichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:28.63,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.64,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I had a huge shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:35.60,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}The Bon Festival is approaching; such coincidences really do happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:39.99,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}She turns seven today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:41.61,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.26,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Your daughter gave me a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:46.71,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I even thought that guy was your ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:48.28,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:52.66,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You can't feel even the existence of any form of intelligence coming from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:03.84,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But it'll be hard to say after half a century or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.38,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Half... century?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:14.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}From a normal perspective, that guy is likely her boyfriend. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:17.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:19.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Well, it's still hard to say. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:21.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:26.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't think it would be so easy for people to find a new lover like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:29.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:32.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to Grandpa's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:39.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That place no longer belongs to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There are people living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:45.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, there aren't any at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But that house belongs to Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:50.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which means it belongs to my mom's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:53.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The altar is also there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:56.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:00.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can't be helped then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:04.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can arrange with Uncle if it's just going into the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:05.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But only the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:08.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,{\alpha&FFFFFF&} I know the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:21.61,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I think I want to accept that job we talked about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.61,0:16:23.12,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What? You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.22,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you feeling all right, Ma-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:29.87,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I became independent for the sake of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.87,0:16:31.78,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's unacceptable if I don't work more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.92,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't you been working all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:36.59,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,This is really a lot more compared to others; I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.59,0:16:38.48,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:42.56,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to work until I forget what I ate last night, that kind of level.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:46.88,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember that sort of thing in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:48.44,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do that,{\alpha&FFFFFF&} I can't seem to forget... many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:51.38,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do that, I can't seem to forget...{\alpha&FFFFFF&} many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:52.91,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do that, I can't seem to forget... many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:02.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:22.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But you're totally different now. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:47.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:50.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The Bellflowers, even the dirt is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:55.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The Bellflowers are very important to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:18:00.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he didn't want to remove them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:05.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle also knows what kind of flower Grandpa likes. {Actually, it's "Uncle knows atleast, what kind of flower Grandpa likes." Please change if necessary. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:09.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that when winter arrives, they'll wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:14.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You won't know whether they'll bloom again when spring comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:17.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The pebbles, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:22.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The weeds will grow really quick if they're not filled in this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's really troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:31.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Luckily, I transferred Rin's Golden Osmanthus. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was rescued. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:41.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it's great we moved Grandpa's Bellflower to our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:46.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It was saved thanks to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:50.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:58.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Change may not be entirely a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:02.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the grave forever belongs to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:06.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1960)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:16.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow~!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:23.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's chocolate flavour!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:28.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:30.64,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you for the final check.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:34.19,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.98,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I really think we won't make it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:43.99,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1000)}I really won't be able to continue drawing if you say such things. Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow~!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:04.05,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll definitely complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:57.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! The night market is going to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:59.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:08.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.95,0:22:14.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:15.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't we agree to meet at the shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:17.79,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My mom is too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:19.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you not wearing your yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.85,0:22:22.09,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump if I wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:25.09,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't I incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:27.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:30.03,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,She said she's wearing a yukata, and told me to wait for her at the shrine. {Yukata 浴衣 = Summer Kimonos. They are lighter and less elaborate. The material is made of cotton so it's cooler and suited to wear for summer. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yukata}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:39.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:40.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The night market is going to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.56,0:22:42.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:48.93,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:50.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.02,0:22:52.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Slow down! It's hard to run with the Geta. {Geta 下駄 = wooden sandals; a japanese footwear which matches the yukata. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geta_(footwear)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.02,0:22:52.73,Note,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Geta 下駄 = wooden sandals; a japanese footwear which matches the yukata.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.73,0:22:53.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.49,0:22:54.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:55.86,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be carried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.86,0:22:57.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:15.93,Credits,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(291,168)}Oyatsu Fansubs Presents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:15.93,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs90\pos(855,397)\blur1\fnFranklin Gothic Heavy}Usagi\NDrop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:42.10,Note,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Sign: August 3, Wednesday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.02,Note,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Sign: August 4, Thursday
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:41.50,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fax0.04\bord3.5\blur0.5\fnMercurius CT Std Medium\c&H313127&\pos(638,160)\3c&HBAB3AB&\frz355.305}Cool Evening Bon Odori Event
