Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.67,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fax0.05\fs35\blur0.8\pos(742,453)\frz355.993\c&H263442&\fnFootlight MT Std Extra Bold}Kaga
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.64,Note,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Sign: Happy Birthday! Rin Kaga
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.04,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k9}{\k13}a{\k52}shi{\k45}ta {\k18}no {\k22}ko{\k25}to {\k21}ha {\k20}{\k20}wa{\k29}ka{\k17}n{\k9}na{\k10}i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.04,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k11}{\k65}明{\k45}日{\k18}の{\k22}こ{\k25}と{\k21}は{\k20}{\k20}わ{\k29}か{\k17}ん{\k9}な{\k10}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.04,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:24.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k22}ko{\k55}re{\k32}tte {\k14}gi{\k48}se{\k19}i {\k21}to{\k41}ha {\k31}chi{\k23}ga{\k19}u.{\k18} {\k24}na{\k18}ni{\k24}ka {\k18}ga {\k25}chi{\k19}ga{\k22}u.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:24.17,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k22}こ{\k55}れ{\k32}って{\k14}ギ{\k48}セ{\k19}イ{\k21}と{\k41}は{\k54}違{\k19}う。{\k18}{\k42}何{\k24}か{\k18}が{\k44}違{\k22}う。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:24.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,This is different from sacrificing. Very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:27.89,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k24}{\k19}ba{\k26}tsu{\k22}ge{\k23}e{\k21}mu {\k20}ja{\k18}n, {\k27}na{\k17}n{\k13}te {\k10}o{\k27}mo{\k35}wa{\k45}na{\k23}i.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:27.89,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k24}{\k45}罰{\k22}ゲ{\k23}ー{\k21}ム{\k20}じゃ{\k18}ん、{\k27}な{\k17}ん{\k13}て{\k37}思{\k35}わ{\k45}な{\k23}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:27.89,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this is a punishment game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:31.06,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k17}{\k21}de, {\k24}na{\k21}n{\k41}de {\k22}na{\k21}no{\k24}ka {\k22}wa{\k37}{\k32}ka{\k13}n{\k24}nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:31.06,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k17}{\k21}で、{\k24}な{\k21}ん{\k41}で{\k22}な{\k21}の{\k24}か{\k22}わ{\k37}{\k32}か{\k13}ん{\k12}な{\k12}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:31.06,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not really sure what it is. {Grammar Check Please}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:34.31,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k16}{\k47}cho{\k25}tto {\k37}sha{\k24}ku{\k25}ze{\k12}n {\k16}to {\k33}shi{\k22}na{\k20}i {\k25}ke{\k23}do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:34.31,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k16}{\k47}ちょ{\k25}っと{\k61}釈{\k37}然{\k16}と{\k33}し{\k22}な{\k20}い{\k25}け{\k23}ど、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:34.31,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I do feel quite troubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:40.48,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k38}{\k23}ki{\k20}mi {\k20}no {\k32}so{\k18}n{\k23}za{\k13}i, {\k25}{\k22}i{\k21}ma {\k25}da{\k19}i{\k22}ji {\k40}da, {\k30}na{\k14}n{\k21}te{\k27}mo{\k10}n{\k29}ja{\k61}na{\k39}i.{\k23}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:40.48,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k38}{\k23}き{\k20}み{\k20}の{\k50}存{\k36}在、{\k25}{\k22}い{\k21}ま{\k44}大{\k22}事{\k40}だ、{\k30}な{\k14}ん{\k21}て{\k27}も{\k10}ん{\k29}じゃ{\k61}な{\k39}い。{\k23}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:40.48,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Your existence is no longer so important anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:46.61,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k20}{\k24}o{\k26}wa{\k22}ra{\k27}na{\k17}i {\k41}ko{\k41}to {\k36}na{\k12}n{\k16}te {\k24}ko{\k18}no{\k41}yo {\k27}no {\k20}do{\k40}ko{\k27}ni{\k20}mo{\k66}na{\k44}i.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:46.61,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k20}{\k24}終{\k26}わ{\k22}ら{\k27}な{\k17}い{\k41}こ{\k41}と{\k36}な{\k12}ん{\k16}て{\k24}こ{\k18}の{\k41}世{\k27}の{\k20}何{\k40}処{\k27}に{\k20}も{\k66}無{\k44}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:46.61,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Things that last forever don't exist anywhere in this world.
